[?2004h> memo += "The audit computes bloat_ratio as dead_pages/total_pages with round-half-up to two decimals, computes size_class from total_pages, and ignores the export size_class column including the medium trap. Autovacuum is checked first, bloat is checked next with stale-statistics cap tightening, and stale statistics are checked last.\n\n"
[?2004l
